# The RAW Sensor window: the Actions grid's Raw Sensor View, Controls/RAW_Sensor.cs over its
# Designer and .resx, ported in crates/mp-gui/src/raw_sensor.rs with the dials in gauge.rs.
#
# The claim: the button shows the form on its Raw Sensor page (the Load selects Radio, then Raw
# Sensor) with its six boxes checked and the combo reading "Update Speed"; every 10 ms the state
# is sampled into the checked curves (an unchecked one is emptied); choosing a rate writes the
# vehicle's ratesensors and asks for the RAW_SENSORS stream; Save CSV names a file, .csv added to
# a bare name, and the samples go into it a line each; the Radio page has the eight inputs and
# eight outputs; the close box closes the form.
#
# Plays the recorded copter flight, which sends RAW_IMU, ATTITUDE, RC_CHANNELS and
# SERVO_OUTPUT_RAW. Run from the repository root:
#   tools/gui-test.sh tests/gui/fly-rawsensor.gui -- file:testdata/mavlink/autotest.tlog

screen fly
window 1600x1200
budget 18

# The button is on the Actions page of the tab control under the HUD.
click fly-tab-actions
expect fly.tab tabActions
expect raw.open false
click fly-rawsensor
expect raw.open true
expect raw.tab Raw Sensor
expect raw.rate Update Speed
expect raw.checked true,true,true,true,true,true
expect raw.points > 3
expect raw.attitude ~ ,

# Unchecking Accel X empties its curve; checking it again fills it.
click raw-chk-ax
expect raw.checked false,true,true,true,true,true
click raw-chk-ax
expect raw.checked true,true,true,true,true,true

# Update Speed: 50 written as the vehicle's ratesensors and asked for.
click raw-rate
click raw-rate-50
expect raw.rate 50
expect vehicle.rates ~ ,50,

# Save CSV: a name with no extension gets .csv, and the samples' lines start.
click raw-savecsv
expect fly.prompt .csv
type $WORK/raw-sensor-samples
click fly-prompt-ok
expect raw.csv ~ raw-sensor-samples.csv
expect raw.csv.lines > 2

# The Radio page: eight inputs and eight outputs from the replayed RC_CHANNELS and
# SERVO_OUTPUT_RAW.
click raw-tab-radio
expect raw.tab Radio
expect raw.rc ~ ,
expect raw.servo ~ ,
click raw-tab-rawsensor
expect raw.tab Raw Sensor

click raw-sensor-close
expect raw.open false
